for (var i = 0; i < elements.length; i++) {
  if (elements[i].id === "myInput") {
    elements[i].focus();
    break;
  }
}
```
This code finds the first input element with the ID "myInput" and focuses on it.

Alternatively, you can use `querySelector` or `getElementById` to get a reference to the element and then call `focus()` on it:
